# Kicked, The Eagles Are Coming! chooses both of Bot1's Ornithopters; Bot2 bolts one in response. The other target is
# still legal, so the spell resolves for it alone (CR 608.2b): one Ornithopter returns to Bot1's hand, the other is in the
# graveyard, and the next upkeep makes one Bird Soldier, for the one creature returned this way.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
The Eagles Are Coming!
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

